    { "key": "quickstart.title", "value": "NEXUS OS Quick Start" },
    { "key": "quickstart.body", "value": "Welcome to your first night shift, Operator.\n\nYOUR TASKS are listed in the Work Queue window (top right) and on the taskbar. Do them in order. Each task has a hint under it.\n\n- Double-click an icon or a file to open it.\n- Drag a window by its title bar to move it.\n- Drag a file onto a folder to move it there.\n- Drag a file onto the Disposal bin to shred it.\n- Right-click anything to see what you can do.\n\nSome programs need clearance you do not have. Stick to your tasks." },
    { "key": "notify.conflict", "value": "Input conflict: device 2 is holding the file. Drag firmly away from it to take it back." },
    { "key": "help.body", "value": "NEXUS OS 4.1 -- QUICK HELP\n\nYOUR SHIFT: your tasks are in the Work Queue (top right, or the Task button on the taskbar). Do them in order; the hint under each task says how.\n\nOPEN: Double-click an icon or file to open it.\nMOVE A WINDOW: Drag it by its title bar.\nMOVE FILES: Open File Manager (Workstation), then drag a file onto a folder in the left pane.\nSHRED: Drag a file onto the Disposal bin, then click Yes.\nWORK ORDERS: Look the owner up in Personnel, then Approve or Reject.\nOPTIONS: Right-click an item to see what you can do with it.\nLOCKED: Some programs and folders need clearance. You will be told if that changes.\n\nNEXUS OS records all activity for quality purposes." },
    { "key": "disclaimer.body", "value": "SECOND CURSOR is a work of fiction. The game does not read your files, move your real mouse, or use your camera or microphone. Every name, company and event in it is invented. Everything that happens here happens inside the game.\n\nPhotosensitivity warning: this game contains flickering, screen glitches and sudden loud sounds. You can reduce flashing at any time from the Esc menu." },
    { "key": "disclaimer.continue", "value": "Click to continue" },
